  "disclaimer": "*This % may represent an aggregate of THC/CBD, THCa/CBDa, THCb/CBDb within the product. Consumers should review the actual product label for exact % of THC/CBD.",
  "description": "Mass Yield's Peanut Butter Gelato delivers premium indica flower in a convenient 3.5g pre-pack, perfect for evening relaxation and unwinding. This strain combines rich, nutty peanut butter notes with sweet, creamy gelato undertones, creating a dessert-like aroma and flavor profile that's truly indulgent. As an indica-dominant flower, Peanut Butter Gelato is known for promoting deep relaxation, stress relief, and a calm, euphoric body high that melts tension away. The dense, resinous buds showcase quality cultivation, making this pre-pack ideal for experienced consumers seeking potent effects or anyone looking to ease into a peaceful night. Whether you're managing discomfort or simply seeking restorative relaxation, this 3.5g jar from Mass Yield offers consistent quality and satisfying effects in every session.",
